    "source": "Your drake grows to Large and its Bite's extra damage becomes 2d6. Reflexive Resistance: when you or your drake takes damage while you are within 30 feet of each other, a reaction gives the one hurt resistance to that damage, a proficiency-bonus number of times per long rest.",
